{"id":"2026-national-1-17","year":2026,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"全国1卷","regions":["山东","广东","湖南","湖北","河北","江苏","福建","浙江","河南","江西","安徽"],"question_no":17,"question_type":"solution","stem":"设整数 $ N\\ge 2 $. 某同学用一个球进行投篮练习，至多投篮 $ N $ 次，当且仅当投中 $ 1 $ 次时或 $ N $ 次均未投中时，停止练习. 设该同学每次投中的概率为 $ p $（$ 0<p<1 $），各次投中与否相互独立. 记 $ X $ 为停止练习时该同学的投篮次数. ； 当 $ N=4 $，$ p=\\frac{1}{3} $ 时，求 $ X $ 的分布列；设 $ k $，$ m $ 均为自然数. ； 当 $ k\\le N-1 $ 时，求 $ P(X>k) $；当 $ k+m\\le N-1 $ 时，证明：$ P(X>k+m\\mid X>k)=P(X>m) $．","options":null,"answer":"（1）X=1,2,3,4对应概率1/3,2/9,4/27,8/27；（2）（i）(1-p)^k；（ii）结论成立","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["几何分布","条件概率","独立性"],"difficulty":"中档","source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2026/2026全国1(山东,广东,湖南,湖北,河北,江苏,福建,浙江,河南,江西,安徽).pdf","sha":"520ab76bc3becadb8246705d261f4562f7d62e12","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"stem_latex":"设整数 \\(N\\ge 2\\). 某同学用一个球进行投篮练习，至多投篮 \\(N\\) 次，当且仅当投中 \\(1\\) 次时或 \\(N\\) 次均未投中时，停止练习. 设该同学每次投中的概率为 \\(p\\)（\\(0<p<1\\)），各次投中与否相互独立. 记 \\(X\\) 为停止练习时该同学的投篮次数.\n\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 当 \\(N=4\\)，\\(p=\\dfrac{1}{3}\\) 时，求 \\(X\\) 的分布列；\n\\item 设 \\(k\\)，\\(m\\) 均为自然数.\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 当 \\(k\\le N-1\\) 时，求 \\(P(X>k)\\)；\n\\item 当 \\(k+m\\le N-1\\) 时，证明：\\(P(X>k+m\\mid X>k)=P(X>m)\\)．\n\\end{enumerate}\n\\end{enumerate}","options_latex":null,"answer_latex":"（1）X=1,2,3,4对应概率1/3,2/9,4/27,8/27；（2）（i）(1-p)^k；（ii）结论成立","needs_figure":false,"figure_refs":[],"figure_urls":[],"reference":{"repository":"DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation","file":"content/2026/national_paper_1.tex","commit":"4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8","blob_sha":"2a8093472f376aaf762a6567e097d71586794f34","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"verification":{"status":"verified","verified_at":"2026-08-31","methods":["upstream_pdf_git_blob_sha","pinned_reference_transcription","pinned_reference_answer_or_short_solution","secondary_answer_check","structural_validation"],"stem_sha256":"e63e8eb75b98f0e29420165579a5b14891f336fea3f9c8802e8d5c005b5c6