{"id":"2026-national-1-18","year":2026,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"全国1卷","regions":["山东","广东","湖南","湖北","河北","江苏","福建","浙江","河南","江西","安徽"],"question_no":18,"question_type":"solution","stem":"已知椭圆 $ C:\\frac{x^2}{a^2}+\\frac{y^2}{b^2}=1 $（$ a>b>0 $）的左焦点为 $ F(-1,0) $，离心率为 $ \\frac{1}{2} $. ； 求 $ C $ 的方程；设 $ O $ 为坐标原点，过 $ F $ 且斜率大于 $ 0 $ 的动直线 $ l $ 与 $ C $ 交于 $ P $，$ Q $ 两点，其中 $ Q $ 在第三象限，直线 $ PO $ 与 $ C $ 的另一个交点为 $ R $. ； 若 $ \\triangle PQR $ 的面积是 $ \\triangle PFO $ 的面积的 $ 3 $ 倍，求 $ l $ 的方程；求 $ \\tan \\angle PQR $ 的最小值．","options":null,"answer":"（1）x²/4+y²/3=1；（2）（i）y=(√5/2)(x+1)；（ii）4√3","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["椭圆","直线与圆锥曲线","面积","最值"],"difficulty":"难题","source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2026/2026全国1(山东,广东,湖南,湖北,河北,江苏,福建,浙江,河南,江西,安徽).pdf","sha":"520ab76bc3becadb8246705d261f4562f7d62e12","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"stem_latex":"已知椭圆 \\(C:\\dfrac{x^2}{a^2}+\\dfrac{y^2}{b^2}=1\\)（\\(a>b>0\\)）的左焦点为 \\(F(-1,0)\\)，离心率为 \\(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\).\n\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 求 \\(C\\) 的方程；\n\\item 设 \\(O\\) 为坐标原点，过 \\(F\\) 且斜率大于 \\(0\\) 的动直线 \\(l\\) 与 \\(C\\) 交于 \\(P\\)，\\(Q\\) 两点，其中 \\(Q\\) 在第三象限，直线 \\(PO\\) 与 \\(C\\) 的另一个交点为 \\(R\\).\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 若 \\(\\triangle PQR\\) 的面积是 \\(\\triangle PFO\\) 的面积的 \\(3\\) 倍，求 \\(l\\) 的方程；\n\\item 求 \\(\\tan \\angle PQR\\) 的最小值．\n\\end{enumerate}\n\\end{enumerate}","options_latex":null,"answer_latex":"（1）x²/4+y²/3=1；（2）（i）y=(√5/2)(x+1)；（ii）4√3","needs_figure":false,"figure_refs":[],"figure_urls":[],"reference":{"repository":"DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation","file":"content/2026/national_paper_1.tex","commit":"4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8","blob_sha":"2a8093472f376aaf762a6567e097d71586794f34","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"verification":{"status":"verified","verified_at":"2026-08-31","methods":["upstream_pdf_git_blob_sha","pinned_reference_transcription","pinned_reference_answer_or_short_solution","secondary_answer_check","structural_validation"],"stem_sha256":"7743