{"id":"2026-national-1-19","year":2026,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"全国1卷","regions":["山东","广东","湖南","湖北","河北","江苏","福建","浙江","河南","江西","安徽"],"question_no":19,"question_type":"solution","stem":"已知函数 $ f(x) $ 的定义域为 $ \\mathbb{R} $，且当 $ x<0 $ 时，$ f(x)=2^x $. 对任意 $ x_0\\in\\mathbb{R} $，定义集合 $ D(x_0)=\\{d\\in\\mathbb{R} \\mid f(x_0+d)>f(x_0)\\} $. ； 若当 $ x\\ge 0 $ 时，$ f(x)=1-x $，求 $ D(-1) $；若 $ f(x) $ 是奇函数，$ f(x_1)\\le f(x_2) $，且 $ x_1x_2\\ne 0 $，证明：$ D(x_2)\\subseteq D(x_1) $；设 $ f(x) $ 满足：\\circled{1} 若 $ f(x_1)\\le f(x_2) $，则 $ D(x_2)\\subseteq D(x_1) $；\\circled{2} 当 $ 0<x<1 $ 时，$ f(x)<f(0) $. ； 证明：$ f(0)\\ge 1 $；证明：$ f(x) $ 在区间 $ (0,+\\infty) $ 单调递增．","options":null,"answer":"（1）(0,3/2)；（2）证明略；（3）（i）f(0)≥1；（ii）证明略","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["函数性质","集合","单调性","反证法"],"difficulty":"难题","source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2026/2026全国1(山东,广东,湖南,湖北,河北,江苏,福建,浙江,河南,江西,安徽).pdf","sha":"520ab76bc3becadb8246705d261f4562f7d62e12","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"stem_latex":"已知函数 \\(f(x)\\) 的定义域为 \\(\\R\\)，且当 \\(x<0\\) 时，\\(f(x)=2^x\\). 对任意 \\(x_0\\in\\R\\)，定义集合 \\(D(x_0)=\\{d\\in\\R \\mid f(x_0+d)>f(x_0)\\}\\).\n\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 若当 \\(x\\ge 0\\) 时，\\(f(x)=1-x\\)，求 \\(D(-1)\\)；\n\\item 若 \\(f(x)\\) 是奇函数，\\(f(x_1)\\le f(x_2)\\)，且 \\(x_1x_2\\ne 0\\)，证明：\\(D(x_2)\\subseteq D(x_1)\\)；\n\\item 设 \\(f(x)\\) 满足：\\circled{1} 若 \\(f(x_1)\\le f(x_2)\\)，则 \\(D(x_2)\\subseteq D(x_1)\\)；\\circled{2} 当 \\(0<x<1\\) 时，\\(f(x)<f(0)\\).\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 证明：\\(f(0)\\ge 1\\)；\n\\item 证明：\\(f(x)\\) 在区间 \\((0,+\\infty)\\) 单调递增．\n\\end{enumerate}\n\\end{enumerate}","options_latex":null,"answer_latex":"（1）(0,3/2)；（2）证明略；（3）（i）f(0)≥1；（ii）证明略","needs_figure":false,"figure_refs":[],"figure_urls":[],"reference":{"repository":"DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation","file":"content/2026/national_paper_1.tex","commit":"4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8","blob_sha":"2a8093472f376aaf762a6567e097d71586794f34","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"verifica